<description>&lt;p&gt;President Paul Biya has finally set a date for the long-delayed national elections, ending his recent public absence. The African Bar Association has called for mediation in the Anglophone crisis while the UN Human Rights Committee released findings on Cameroon’s situation. Nigeria, Cameroon, Chad and Niger have approved a 5 km cross-border military pursuit to combat terrorism, extending operations beyond national borders, and Cameroon has formed a new elite unit to fight Lake Chad terrorism. Separatist leader Lucas Ayaba pleaded not guilty at a war-crimes trial in Norway. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE53VHpvaWZwdEVfOHdtQnpLYl9USDRxWGtBbVZaWUpuSHBURDhNWmxPZGQxTW9PNnhKaUdnYTZSLXZZRmVmNm12VWRMcTBMcTV3WFp1dlZGNjNtR0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNeWpNNmgtX0w0RzVaTjFRTVVCWlEyek90cm1Pa0J3V1BJRVpzQ2o0SXhib2ZlbEtPcUtFaF9DU0JqYkxBY2o5ZDI4X0xTNklZR2hDSXlSZXN5RzZRUmZwcEk2VUU3aHdHckVjY2M0S1Y3UHlPZFVPVDdaMk55ekgwV3BXRU9YV3dXcjliVjhKS0FETkpP?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQNHRNM3N0OWk2X1VJbm1KSGdGWlFTeFFHdU9LVHRoTHZjdUZGN2RLeXZCRHdpckRnbndHQ2dzWEh0dmFURmFpV3NHYU5mNjdKTzJHdzZreVB4YUs3MkR4ZTdueExXTjRmTFZNbThLNDBsZWJjY2pMSHc0TmFORkpSVXFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Beast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOYlItVllIc21FYndyc19fV2x3Uk95bGJ2bGliazNIYkE0em94ajd6Qm1Qd05hXzNWQlJMZFdzUEhOSzJmT0N4bEo4Zi1UVU9BelJIZXhJZGdPcld